    "name": "Sandloop",
    "steam_appid": 3783310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the lands of Iman, a festival is held every year. During the celebrations, a special ceremony takes place where the young are given important clothes and the Mindil \u2014magical cloths that hide long-forgotten powers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year, it is Hura\u2019s turn, but her experience will be very different from the ones before. Strangers attack the village, trying to steal an ancient power. In the middle of the chaos, Hura escapes and finds a loom that gives her magical powers through her new clothes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the blessing of the tribe\u2019s elder, she sets out on a journey to <strong>learn new abilities</strong>, stop the invaders, and <strong>uncover a mystery</strong> that weaves itself with every jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/e69f8807f556c4be9d7c5cd874cf1c65.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=692 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-style 3D platformer with controls modernized to today's standards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities that let you move gracefully and fluidly across the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy story with a moral to unravel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various mini-games to enjoy and earn coins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Iman</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a map divided into four unique, interconnected zones where you'll face challenges and uncover new abilities to enhance your moveset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/27002f683839a2ffbf138d20439ae9b4.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your Mindil</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various skills by exploring the world. Theses abilities will improve your mobility and grant acces to new, previously unreachable areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/fe1b446cbeab18699137a31243383b9d.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find ancient magic to boost your powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden throughout the map are fragments of stamina and health. Collect them to increase Hura's edurance and perform special abilities more frequently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/e9cfa03bdae7f10c08039f6b83b33675.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight the invaders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat revolves around agility, timing and precision. Master your movement abilities to dodge deadly attacks and outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/f2bcb3d33e87237a48810f2246e439a5.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optimize your time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magical lands of Iman are trapped in a time loop. Stop the invaders before the day resets and seize the power of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/7d74832111d13feb077ddd029c53f7ee.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the lands of Iman, a festival is held every year. During the celebrations, a special ceremony takes place where the young are given important clothes and the Mindil \u2014magical cloths that hide long-forgotten powers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year, it is Hura\u2019s turn, but her experience will be very different from the ones before. Strangers attack the village, trying to steal an ancient power. In the middle of the chaos, Hura escapes and finds a loom that gives her magical powers through her new clothes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the blessing of the tribe\u2019s elder, she sets out on a journey to <strong>learn new abilities</strong>, stop the invaders, and <strong>uncover a mystery</strong> that weaves itself with every jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/e69f8807f556c4be9d7c5cd874cf1c65.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=692 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-style 3D platformer with controls modernized to today's standards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities that let you move gracefully and fluidly across the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy story with a moral to unravel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various mini-games to enjoy and earn coins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Iman</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a map divided into four unique, interconnected zones where you'll face challenges and uncover new abilities to enhance your moveset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/27002f683839a2ffbf138d20439ae9b4.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your Mindil</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various skills by exploring the world. Theses abilities will improve your mobility and grant acces to new, previously unreachable areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/fe1b446cbeab18699137a31243383b9d.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find ancient magic to boost your powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden throughout the map are fragments of stamina and health. Collect them to increase Hura's edurance and perform special abilities more frequently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/e9cfa03bdae7f10c08039f6b83b33675.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight the invaders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat revolves around agility, timing and precision. Master your movement abilities to dodge deadly attacks and outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/f2bcb3d33e87237a48810f2246e439a5.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optimize your time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magical lands of Iman are trapped in a time loop. Stop the invaders before the day resets and seize the power of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783310/extras/7d74832111d13feb077ddd029c53f7ee.avif?t=1749334135\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
